<statement>
<p>
A fair coin is tossed three times in succession. Find the probability of tossing the following:</p>
<p>
(a)  Exactly <m>\displaystyle{1}</m> tail</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(b)  Exactly <m>\displaystyle{2}</m> heads</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(c)  The same number of heads as tails</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
<p>
(d)  At least <m>\displaystyle{1}</m> head and at least <m>\displaystyle{1}</m> tail</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   
</p>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{3}}{{8}}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{3}}{{8}}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle{0}</m></li><li><m>\displaystyle\frac{{3}}{{4}}</m></li></ul></p>
</answer>

